{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110205826023706624", "3_2110205825172267008", "3_2110205825197506560"]}, "author_id": "1923918769463726080", "created_at": "2026-10-14T03:08:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110206123857125539"], "id": "2110206123857125539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@SuvenduWB @BJP4Bengal @namo_nav  \n\nThank you for painting Park Street with the joy of Durga Puja.\n\nCan’t express in words the feeling of getting the blessing from Ma Durga at Allen Park. \n\nWish @SuvenduWB to transform WB’ economy in same way. https://t.co/YuZjNDROck", "url": "https://x.com/Dhapa_Tappa/status/2110206123857125539"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110049592444321798"]}, "author_id": "868024260408758272", "created_at": "2026-10-13T16:46:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110049611515863519"], "id": "2110049611515863519", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The ever beautiful and enigmatic Maa Durga at Allen Park, Park Street 🥹🙏🏻🪷 https://t.co/9TySxNiZKP https://t.co/vrO8mDscYh", "url": "https://x.com/drabhinabapal7/status/2110049611515863519"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110049379776372736"]}, "author_id": "868024260408758272", "created_at": "2026-10-13T16:45:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110049395760824327"], "id": "2110049395760824327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Maa Durga at Allen Park, Park Street 🙏🏻 https://t.co/WnjPcRsmeT", "url": "https://x.com/drabhinabapal7/status/2110049395760824327"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109872638873190401", "3_2109872655088443392", "3_2109872666345910272", "3_2109872679453089792"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T05:03:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109872690597433736"], "id": "2109872690597433736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 833, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "📍 Kolkata Sanatani Sangha (Allen Park).\n\n🎨 Subrata Banerjee, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Suvendu Adhikari.\n\n👉 The pandal has a 3D laser show going on. Shiva's face is basically animated. There's also Aghori Nritya going on just beside the pandal!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/Blc8DTRRYG", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109872690597433736"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109872578605260800", "3_2109872591590887424", "3_2109872602676416512", "3_2109872616681213952"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T05:03:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109872626764259576"], "id": "2109872626764259576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 11150, "like_count": 198, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "📍 Kolkata Sanatani Sangha (Allen Park, Park Street).\n\n🎨 Subrata Banerjee, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Suvendu Adhikari.\n\n🌟 The theme is Shiva's Tandav.\n\n👉 For a first attempt, this gets a 10/10. The Maa Durga idol is GORGEOUS!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/Je0XaObe3k https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109872626764259576"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109846409046605824", "3_2109846415820402688", "3_2109846422606766080", "3_2109846429917409281"]}, "author_id": "1111872737646006272", "created_at": "2026-10-13T03:19:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109846440797491529"], "id": "2109846440797491529", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 918, "start": 908, "tag": "DurgaPuja"}], "mentions": [{"end": 204, "id": "1340509422582333442", "start": 194, "username": "SuvenduWB"}, {"end": 344, "id": "1138322180008136704", "start": 331, "username": "DrSukantaBJP"}, {"end": 442, "id": "249675489", "start": 429, "username": "UmeshRai_BJP"}, {"end": 931, "id": "2984417534", "start": 920, "username": "BJP4Bengal"}]}, "text": "For the first time this year, Durga Puja has been organised at Allen Park on the iconic Park Street in Kolkata. Last night, the Puja was formally inaugurated by the Hon’ble Chief Minister, Shri @SuvenduWB Ji.\n\nI was present at the inauguration ceremony. Also present on the occasion were Union Minister of State for Education Shri @DrSukantaBJP , Minister of State for Municipal Affairs and Urban Development of West Bengal Shri @UmeshRai_BJP , South Kolkata BJP President Shri Anupam Bhattacharya, one of the key organisers of the Puja, Shri Sankudeb Panda, BJP leader Shri Naveen Mishra, and other distinguished dignitaries.\n\nThe introduction of this new Durga Puja at Park Street, one of Kolkata’s prominent landmarks, will further enhance the joy and enthusiasm of the Durga Puja festivities. May the blessings of Maa Durga fill everyone’s lives with happiness, peace, and prosperity.\n\nJai Maa Durga! 🙏🚩\n#DurgaPuja \n@BJP4Bengal"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3502, "like_count": 108, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "For the first time this year, Durga Puja has been organised at Allen Park on the iconic Park Street in Kolkata. Last night, the Puja was formally inaugurated by the Hon’ble Chief Minister, Shri @SuvenduWB Ji.\n\nI was present at the inauguration ceremony. Also present on the https://t.co/wLEgv2AtL4", "url": "https://x.com/ArjunsinghWB/status/2109846440797491529"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109527758665854976", "3_2109527771450134528"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-12T06:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109527792610374058"], "id": "2109527792610374058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 3881, "like_count": 110, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Visited the 23 Palli Durga Temple in Harish Mukherjee Road, Kolkata. This beautiful temple where I go every year on the day of Mahalaya is directly opposite to Shantiniketan the house of TMC politician Abhishek Banerjee. https://t.co/gT7b3EOQPc", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2109527792610374058"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109498295630643200", "3_2109498304317022208"]}, "author_id": "1313326464461283328", "created_at": "2026-10-12T04:16:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109498311216648699"], "id": "2109498311216648699", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 987, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "So Allen Park is hosting Durga Puja for first time this year &amp; the pandal seems just rip-off close to Chetla Agrani’s 2024 pandal. 🙂 The upcoming one from Allen Park on left. I mean, why couldn’t they try out something new instead of cheap ripping off by  Subrata Banerjee 🤦🙂 https://t.co/FausTbuDw1", "url": "https://x.com/horek_rokom/status/2109498311216648699"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 2048, "media_key": "3_2110205826023706624", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUj1BLcaUAAupXA.jpg", "width": 1536}, {"height": 1536, "media_key": "3_2110205825172267008", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUj1BIRaYAAFyKj.jpg", "width": 2048}, {"height": 2048, "media_key": "3_2110205825197506560", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUj1BIXbgAAHYF1.jpg", "width": 1536}, {"height": 3946, "media_key": "3_2110049592444321798", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUhm7MAaAAYpvJS.jpg", "width": 2959}, {"height": 3946, "media_key": "3_2110049379776372736", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUhmuzwaoAAr1V4.jpg", "width": 2959}, {"height": 1972, "media_key": "3_2109872638873190401", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUfF_IlaQAEWl2G.jpg", "width": 3916}, {"height": 318